WEBVTT

00:00:03.248 --> 00:00:05.937
Content is categorized with fields.

00:00:05.937 --> 00:00:07.839
Let's edit a Blog Post.

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:11.774
Below the body, it has two fields that use taxonomies:

00:00:11.774 --> 00:00:13.348
Tags and Category.

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:18.384
Category accepts one term, and only a term without children.

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.120
Travel is selected.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:26.161
Food is a parent, so it is disabled, while Recipes and Restaurants can be chosen.

00:00:26.656 --> 00:00:28.550
Tags accepts several terms.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.200
Clicking the box lists the existing tags, and you select the ones you want.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.506
If you type a name that does not exist, pressing Enter creates a tag.

00:00:37.966 --> 00:00:42.346
When the post is published, the terms you selected are saved with it.

00:00:42.346 --> 00:00:46.726
Because editors choose from the list, every post uses the same names.

